<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Seafood Fried Rice Recipe</title>
    <style>
        /* Basic Reset & Global Box-Sizing */
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f4f6f8;
            color: #333333;
            line-height: 1.6;
            padding: 30px 15px;
        }

        /* Card Wrapper with Shadow & Hover Effect */
        .recipe-card {
            max-width: 680px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
            overflow: hidden;
            transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
        }

        .recipe-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-4px);
            box-shadow: 0 12px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
        }

        /* Header Image Container */
        .image-container {
            width: 100%;
            height: 280px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .recipe-image {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
            display: block;
        }

        /* Recipe Content Layout */
        .recipe-content {
            padding: 24px 28px;
        }

        .recipe-title {
            color: #c62828;
            font-size: 26px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        /* Metadata Badges Container */
        .recipe-meta {
            display: flex;
            gap: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }

        .meta-item {
            background-color: #fff3e0;
            color: #e65100;
            padding: 6px 14px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        /* Section Layout */
        .recipe-section {
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }

        .section-title {
            font-size: 18px;
            color: #2c3e50;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #ffe082;
            padding-bottom: 6px;
            margin-bottom: 14px;
        }

        /* Interactive Checkbox Styling */
        .ingredients-list {
            list-style: none;
        }

        .ingredients-list li {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .ingredients-list input[type="checkbox"] {
            appearance: none;
            -webkit-appearance: none;
            width: 18px;
            height: 18px;
            border: 2px solid #90a4ae;
            border-radius: 4px;
            outline: none;
            cursor: pointer;
            margin-right: 12px;
            position: relative;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }

        .ingredients-list input[type="checkbox"]:checked {
            background-color: #2e7d32;
            border-color: #2e7d32;
        }

        .ingredients-list input[type="checkbox"]:checked::after {
            content: '✓';
            position: absolute;
            color: white;
            font-size: 12px;
            top: 50%;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
        }

        .ingredients-list input[type="checkbox"]:checked + label {
            text-decoration: line-through;
            color: #888888;
        }

        /* Steps List Styling */
        .steps-list {
            padding-left: 20px;
        }

        .steps-list li {
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            color: #444444;
        }

        .step-label {
            color: #c62828;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <article class="recipe-card">
        <!-- Recipe Header Image -->
        <div class="image-container">
            <img class="recipe-image" src="https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcQb33Qq_-gtOvyviHGIZe4N13cjs0DlOf8BPhAHORBk1Tc8R2ss13F_grSK&s=10" alt="Seafood Fried Rice">
        </div>

        <div class="recipe-content">
            <header>
                <h1 class="recipe-title">Seafood Fried Rice (Nasi Goreng Seafood) (๑ᵔ⤙ᵔ๑)</h1>

                <!-- Metadata Badges -->
                <div class="recipe-meta">
                    <span class="meta-item">15 Mins</span>
                    <span class="meta-item">🔥 Medium</span>
                    <span class="meta-item">🍽️ 1-2 Servings</span>
                </div>
            </header>

            <!-- Ingredients Section -->
            <section class="recipe-section">
                <h2 class="section-title">Ingredients</h2>
                
                <h3 style="font-size: 15px; margin: 10px 0 8px 0; color: #555;">Main Ingredients:</h3>
                <ul class="ingredients-list">
                    <li><input type="checkbox" id="ing1"><label for="ing1">300g cold white rice (leftover/day-old)</label></li>
                    <li><input type="checkbox" id="ing2"><label for="ing2">100g peeled shrimp (tail left on)</label></li>
                    <li><input type="checkbox" id="ing3"><label for="ing3">100g squid, cleaned and cut into rings</label></li>
                    <li><input type="checkbox" id="ing4"><label for="ing4">2 eggs, beaten</label></li>
                    <li><input type="checkbox" id="ing5"><label for="ing5">3 cloves garlic, finely minced</label></li>
                    <li><input type="checkbox" id="ing6"><label for="ing6">1/2 onion, chopped</label></li>
                    <li><input type="checkbox" id="ing7"><label for="ing7">1 stalk green onion, diagonally sliced</label></li>
                </ul>

                <h3 style="font-size: 15px; margin: 14px 0 8px 0; color: #555;">Sauce Mix & Seasonings:</h3>
                <ul class="ingredients-list">
                    <li><input type="checkbox" id="ing8"><label for="ing8">1.5 tbsp oyster sauce</label></li>
                    <li><input type="checkbox" id="ing9"><label for="ing9">1 tbsp light soy sauce</label></li>
                    <li><input type="checkbox" id="ing10"><label for="ing10">1 tsp fish sauce</label></li>
                    <li><input type="checkbox" id="ing11"><label for="ing11">1 tsp sesame oil</label></li>
                    <li><input type="checkbox" id="ing12"><label for="ing12">1/2 tsp ground white pepper</label></li>
                    <li><input type="checkbox" id="ing13"><label for="ing13">1/2 tsp salt or mushroom seasoning</label></li>
                    <li><input type="checkbox" id="ing14"><label for="ing14">Cooking oil as needed</label></li>
                </ul>
            </section>

            <!-- Cooking Steps Section -->
            <section class="recipe-section">
                <h2 class="section-title">Instructions</h2>
                <ol class="steps-list">
                    <li><strong class="step-label">Sauté seafood:</strong> Heat a little oil in a wok, stir fry the shrimp and squid for 1 to 2 minutes until color changes. Remove and set aside.</li>
                    <li><strong class="step-label">Sauté aromatics:</strong> In the same wok, stir fry minced garlic and chopped onion until fragrant and soft.</li>
                    <li><strong class="step-label">Scramble the eggs:</strong> Push aromatics to the side of the wok, pour beaten eggs into the empty space, and scramble until set.</li>
                    <li><strong class="step-label">Add rice and sauces:</strong> Add cold white rice, then pour in oyster sauce, light soy sauce, fish sauce, white pepper, and salt. Stir thoroughly over high heat.</li>
                    <li><strong class="step-label">Combine seafood:</strong> Readd the stir fried shrimp and squid back into the wok, add green onions and sesame oil. Stir quickly for 1 minute.</li>
                    <li><strong class="step-label">Serve:</strong> Transfer to a plate and serve hot with lemon or lime wedges on the side.</li>
                </ol>
            </section>
        </div>
    </article>

</body>
</html>
